-----------------------------------------------+-------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+------------------+----------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------
 authenticated_dynamic_sql_function_executable | ERROR | Function `public.exec_sql(query text)` is `SECURITY DEFINER`, can be executed by the `authenticated` role via `/rest/v1/rpc/exec_sql`, and appears to run SQL passed in `query`. Revoke `EXECUTE` if that is not intentional. | true             | ["query"]      | authenticated_dynamic_sql_function_executable_public_exec_sql_query text
(1 row)

  ----------------------------------------
